<article data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>
<h2 data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>What is Dudley Development?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Dudley Development is an independent iOS app studio that builds small, polished iPhone apps across entertainment, conversation, games, and client work.</p>
<a href="/about" data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Source page</a>
</article><article data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>
<h2 data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>What is VibeRater Social?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>VibeRater Social 2.1 is live with Timeline and Full Screen feeds, VibeRodeo creation, Repli rooms and VibeShop, Radar events, following, and search across people, posts, places, and hashtags.</p>
<a href="/answers/viberater-social/" data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Source page</a>
</article><article data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>
<h2 data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Which Dudley apps are current?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Current live releases include VibeRater Social 2.1 and Where&#39;s This House? 2.0, alongside Monetary Policy: Independence Day and Table Talk: Conversation Cards.</p>
<a href="/#work" data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Source page</a>
</article><article data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>
<h2 data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Does Dudley sell personal data?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>No. Dudley does not sell personal data. Each privacy page explains the app-specific details, including ads, local data, accounts, and third-party services where relevant.</p>
<a href="/privacy/" data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Source page</a>
</article><article data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>
<h2 data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>How do I get support?</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Use the support page for app-specific FAQs or email support@dudleyapps.com with the app, screen, device, iOS version, and a screenshot or recording.</p>
<a href="/support/" data-astro-cid-tcdv7xhl>Source page</a>
</article>
